usage: local_models.py draft-verify [-h] --output OUTPUT [--model MODEL]
                                    [--max-tokens MAX_TOKENS]
                                    input task

positional arguments:
  input                 UTF-8 source the claims must cite
  task                  UTF-8 file with the bounded drafting task

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT       JSON result file
  --model MODEL         TypeSafe model name or alias
  --max-tokens MAX_TOKENS
                        Flash output budget (a 248-line source needed about
                        5,200; 4096 truncated it)
